    "description": "Technical bounded PNG transfer in the already-connected helper; no image bytes through app bridge or Canvas mutations. Programmatically read/encode/submit bytes, never copy payload through model context or print it. Begin binds project/session/activation and this MCP connection. Append strict sequential offsets; accepted-handle append/finalize failures terminate that upload. Finalize returns canonical receipt only after validation; repeated finalize is rejected, use status after a lost response. Status never extends TTL. Cancel receiving uploads; disconnect abandons them. Use the generated native staging reference. Do not reuse transfer handles across connections. No file paths accepted.",
